        title: "Dhiktana Dhiktana - The Hustle Flip l Mad Trip  | MTV Hustle 4",
        description:
          "\"This song is a reimagined version of the classic Bollywood track 'Dhiktana Dhiktana', transformed into a melancholic reflection on loneliness and disillusionment. By flipping the upbeat original into a somber tone, the song conveys the harsh reality that no one in this world truly belongs to you. It redefines the familiar melody to evoke a sense of sadness and introspection, making it a poignant commentary on isolation and unfulfilled connections.\n\nSong Credits\n\nTrack Name: Dhiktana Dhiktana - The Hustle Flip\nWritten & Performed By: @MadTrip05 \nMusic Producer: Aditya Pushkarna\nPrimary Artist: @MadTrip05 \nTrack Name: Dhiktana Dhiktana - The Hustle Flip\nSinger/Performed By/Cast: @MadTrip05 \nLyricist/Written By: @MadTrip05 \nMusic Produced By: Aditya Pushkarna\nCo-Composer: Aditya Pushkarna\nMusic Label: Saregama\nGenre: Hip Hop\nSub-Genre: Rap\nLanguage:Hindi\nCountry of Origin/Source: India\n\n\nFollow Kaanphod to know more: \n👉 Subscribe to KaanPhod : https://www.youtube.com/@KaanPhodMusic \n👉 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/kaanphod \n👉 Follow us on X: https://x.com/kaanphodmusic?s=11 \n👉 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kaanphodmusic/ \n\n\nLyrics\n\nMad Trip@MadTrip05 \n\nKaisa hai tu kaise hain sab \nPoochhe khairiyat par dekhe haisiyat sab\npata chala sirf paison se rishte Hain\ntoh ab mere sirf paison se rishte hain\n\nHaan maine jeet dekhi \nHaan maine  haar dekhi\nTedha bann ke chalna padta\nWarna neki maar degi\n\nSadkon pe maar dekhi\nApno mein khaar dekhi\nQatl-e-aam ki khabrein Aksar \nqabrein toh aam dekhi\n\nDekhi saanp Seedhi\nBaatein likhun saaf seedhi\nKisi ko bhi Sunn-ni nahi hai\nYahan pe meri aap beeti\n\nRishton mein rajneeti\nKisse bas jaydaad ke hisse na khaak mili\nkishton mein haar mili\n\nDekhi Kitni shakal gayi pal mein Badal\nmere Seene mein kyun hoti Har pal hulchul\n\nHar pal chanchal mann karey bhag-dadd\nAb dil mera khaali Ghar lage khandar\n\nGhooma nahi main duniya  jahaanon mein kabhi \nKyun ki pehle se hi maine dekh liya sab shayad\nBura waqt bhi dikha ke jaayega ek Jaadu \nTu Khaali 10 tak ginn ho jayenge sab gayab\n\nAe khuda mujhe kya hua\nKyun lagta yeh begaana\nTu bataa main hoon kahan\nManzil ki raah dikhlana\n\nDhiktana dhiktana dhiktana\nYahan apno mein apna koi dikhta na\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nSaala sacchi mein saccha koi rishta na\n\nDhiktana dhiktana dhiktana\nYahan apno mein apna koi dikhta na\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nSaala sacchi mein saccha koi rishta na\n\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nDhik dhiktana dhiktana dhiktana\n\nDhiktana dhiktana dhiktana\nDhik dhiktana dhiktana dhiktana\n\nAansu toh roz aaye par koi na ponchh paaye \nBolun dil ki baatein par dil tak nahi yeh pahunch paaye\nDhokhe toh bahut khaaye woh toh roz ka hai \nSaare apna soche tu apno ka sochta hai kyun\n\ndoon main ghar walon ko dosh jo sochte mera roz\nAfsos main unpe bojh main Kosta khud ko bahut\nJailon se bhi zyaada logon ke mann mein hai chor \nwoh dekhe kab dheela ho naada \nkab kheenche langot\n\nJaana kahan soojhta bhi nahi\nHo Bhookhe paet nange paanv \ntoh koi thookta bhi nahi\nsawaal ka jawaab dene se baney crorepati\nLekin hum jaison ko yahan koi poochhta hi nahi\n\nBina taane khaaye  milti hain taaliyaan bhi na\nMilti kaamyabi toh yeh dekhe khaamiyan bhi na\n\nKaafi ghalatiyan bhi Kari \nghalati se seekha bhi main\nYeh duniya ek kitaab toh baatein kitaabi yeh\nChunautiyaan hain log hai kya ismein koi shaq\nRoz bolun bhagwan se Enough is enough\n\nKaash Miley hote gham kam re\nHumein bhi koi miley hote humdum re\nGhutt-te hain andar hi andar se\nAb Chubhte hain mujh ko yeh bandh kamre\n\nMain So paaun kabhi chain se\nAise bhi din dikhlana \nKho jaaunga bheed mein\nTu haath thaam lega na\n\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nYahan apno mein apna koi dikhta na\nDhiktana tiktana  dhiktana\nSaala sacchi mein saccha koi rishta na\n\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nYahan apno mein apna koi dikhta na\nDhiktana tiktana dhiktana\nSaala sacchi mein saccha koi rishta na\n\nApno ko dekha apno se ladte toh apna hai kaun aaya ek sawaal\nGairon ko dekha maine zakhmon ko bharte toh apna hai kaun phir aaya ek sawaal\n\n-----\nFollow Kaanphod to know more:\n👉 Subscribe to KaanPhod : https://www.youtube.com/@KaanPhodMusic \n👉 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/kaanphod \n👉 Follow us on X: https://x.com/kaanphodmusic?s=11 \n👉 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kaanphodmusic/ \n\n\n----\n#RoyalEnfieldHunter MTV Hustle 4 Hip-Hop, Don’t Stop, Co-Powered by #Wildstone #boAtLifestyle & #WokTokByVeeba. Every Sat-Sun 7PM only on @mtvindia & @officialjiocinema.\n\n#MTVHustle #MTVHustle4 #Hustle4 #HipHopDontStop\"",
